<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>How to use Codex, Claude Code, or Gemini CLI with the tools you already have | StackOS</title><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_h1qbsy.png"><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_h1qbsy.png"><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_h1qbsy.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="600"><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="600"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.HVu_FLFq.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/_slug_.4selAjHH.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/GeneratedVisual.Cf-hdjOs.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ArticleCard.ELpExItc.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/LibraryFrame.CD2pOTex.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ArticleConceptVisual.N7-5Wp3V.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ProsePre.D5orA6B_.css" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/library/articles/use-codex-claude-gemini-with-existing-tools/_payload.json?aa586fb3-d485-480b-909f-6b016269cb06"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CHhb2Wy-.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CuZLvxZo.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DLjPO0uC.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/D9KO13qN.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DLJtTT7f.js"><link rel="modulepreload"